 "summary": "No. On BTC, ETH and SOL, every StochRSI(14,14,3,3) setting did the same as random entries on 1h, 4h and daily, long or short, as a level or as a cross. The only pooled result outside the luck band is a short on daily %K crossing down %D above 80: it did 3.2% worse than random, and it rests on one stretch of SOL signals between Jul 27 and Aug 21, 2021.",
